 . Things to Watch For

- Popup Blockers: 
 Most browsers will block `window.open()` unless the user directly triggers it (like clicking a button), especially if not from a user event.
 - If it’s blocked, you may see a browser warning in the address bar or in the Dev Tools console.
- Session Storage: 
 The window will only open once per browser session. To test again, clear session storage or use incognito/private mode.
 - Or, run this in the console: `sessionStorage.removeItem("starterTagsOpened")`

